summary={'A1':'Per-session voter matches produce monotone commitment after current-term startIndex; followers use accepted leader commit indications.','A2':'Pre-vote and persisted voting establish a local leader role; RPCs, response signals, lease checks, removal and transfer change it. Verification is a separate authority observation path.','A3':'Constructor rebuilds term, history and membership; snapshot install restores FSM before reply; manual restore is explicitly exceptional.','A4':'Latest/committed log configurations select voting and commitment membership while replication includes nonvoters.','A5':'Dedicated FSM worker consumes committed batches and returns application responses; dispatch progress is not completion.','A6':'LogStore and StableStore support retained logs and terms/votes; snapshot worker persists applied state. In-repository InmemStore is test-only; other backend semantics remain open.','A7':'Apply admission is a future, not completion; nonleader, shutdown, enqueue and leadership-loss cases differ. VerifyLeader promises leadership assurance.'}
M={'version':1,'target_profile':{'system_boundary':'Captured Go raft library: main role loop, per-peer replication and heartbeats, FSM and snapshot workers, injectable transports/stores/FSM. No production deployment or caller application is supplied.','protocol_contexts':['Per-Raft term and role','Per-leader commitment object and worker generation','Latest and committed indexed membership','Per-entry index/term and per-future identity'],'external_interfaces':['Apply/ApplyLog, VerifyLeader, membership APIs, Restore','Transport RPC and optional heartbeat fast path','LogStore, StableStore, SnapshotStore and caller FSM'],'ownership':['Main loop owns leader state and configuration','Independent workers send support through locked commitment and verification objects','Network fast-path may process empty heartbeats concurrently with blocking main RPC'],'selection_injection':['NewRaft takes caller-supplied stores, transport, FSM and validated Config; in-repository implementations are not assumed externalized'],'variants':['Protocol compatibility branches','PreVoteDisabled or unsupported transport','BatchingFSM and ConfigurationStore','Network fast-path vs in-memory transport','MonotonicLogStore and NoSnapshotRestoreOnStart'],'source_ids':['S-startup','S-inmem-transport','S-net-fastpath','S-inmem-store','S-transport-contract'],'unknowns':['Full production persistence, transport failure semantics and application-specific FSM contracts remain outside this initial trace']},'activities':[dict(class_id=a,applicability='applicable',purpose=roles[a]['relation'],realization_summary=summary[a],source_ids=activity_sources[a]) for a in roles],'behaviors':B,'facts':F,'surfaces':[], 'core_overview':{}}
